WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.520
I'm not much of a teacher.

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:02.690
Oh, now you tell me.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.160
But I do have a great idea for science club
tomorrow.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.700
Are you going to go back in time and keep
yourself from delivering that lecture?

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:19.540
I know you still don't believe me. But isn't
the foundation of science to have an open mind?

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.270
Science is about proof.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:30.850
You want proof? If I remember right, this
week, a freak snowfall closed a main road

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.560
between here and Willoughby.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:38.740
This week's forecast is nothing but clear
sunny skies.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.210
Ah. We'll see.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.350
This one's pretty nice.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.540
That's a way better tree over there.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:48.850
You're doing it again.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:49.840
Huh?

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.690
Every single time I do something, you always have
to try to outdo me.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.040
No, that's all in your head.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:59.590
The academic decathlon, the 4-H
competition. Oh, I could go on.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.340
You remember all of that? That's just proof
that you've been jealous of me ever since

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.300
back in high school.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.110
What? You've always been jealous of me.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:11.330
Please. I love my life.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:12.860
Do you?

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:21.360
Okay, fine, I admit it. My life is far from
perfect.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:27.090
But this week, I have a second chance. And I'm going to make
a difference.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.220
Starting with getting Miss Nelson that tree.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:34.670
Oh! Watch out!

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:38.330
I'd say the weather has changed.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.440
Well, that's hardly proof.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.410
Time will tell.

